{"id": "34389", "title": "春之梦幻", "author": "岑凯伦", "category": "文学名著", "count": 13, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34389.htm", "intro": "内容提要 \r\n    马家四千金：秋诗、爱诗、梦诗、丽诗，都有诗一样的青春，诗一样的美丽。在爱情方面，也都有诗一样的体验，秋诗如小绝句，精致美艳；爱诗如排律，起承转合，波澜起伏；梦诗、丽诗如自由体，热情奔放。但最终都有一个诗一般美丽的结局。", "base": "files/article/html/34/34389", "chapters": [{"title": "第01节", "file": "2184568.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第02节", "file": "2184569.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第03节", "file": "2184570.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第04节", "file": "2184571.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第05节", "file": "2184572.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第06节", "file": "2184573.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第07节", "file": "2184574.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第08节", "file": "2184575.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第09节", "file": "2184576.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10节", "file": "2184577.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11节", "file": "2184578.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12节", "file": "2184579.html", "available": false}, {"title": "后语", "file": "2184580.html", "available": false}]}